          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "6F6D1E53F5073D49",
      "text": "Als ich... also... so mo-mo-mäßig rumgetanzt bin...\\nDavon hast du doch kein Video oder so was\\r\\ngemacht, oder?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "FE6373F7F3B19B98",
      "text": "Natürlich nicht!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "FE6376F7F3B1A0B1",
      "text": "Die Sache ist die...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "6F6D1B53F5073830",
      "text": "*seufz* Ein Glück!!\\c\\nIch wurde damals zwar von diesem Pokémon\\nfremdgesteuert, aber die Sache ist trotzdem der\\r\\neinzige Schandfleck in meinem Leben![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 111,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 151,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "5D9DC1A95B44B356",
      "text": "Waaas?! Das gibt’s ja wohl nicht! Lösch das alles!\\nUnd zwar auf der Stelle!![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "6F6D1C53F50739E3",
      "text": "Wenn es davon Aufnahmen gäbe, könnten die mir\\nspäter Probleme bereiten, wenn ich berühmt bin.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "6F6D2153F5074262",
      "text": "Und was hatte es eigentlich mit diesem Pokémon\\nauf sich? Infamomo oder so?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_05",
      "hash64": "6F6D2253F5074415",
      "text": "Es hatte eine ähnliche Aura wie die drei\\nGefährten, fandest du nicht auch?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 74,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_select_03",
      "hash64": "FE6375F7F3B19EFE",
      "text": "Jetzt, wo du es sagst...!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_select_04",
      "hash64": "FE6378F7F3B1A417",
      "text": "Meinst du?",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_06",
      "hash64": "6F6D1F53F5073EFC",
      "text": "Ja, ich bin mir sicher! Da muss es irgendeine\\nVerbindung geben![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 63,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp02_07",
      "hash64": "6F6D2053F50740AF",
      "text": "Aber wir können ja schlecht die Pokémon selbst\\nbefragen... Die Wahrheit bleibt also weiterhin\\r\\nein Rätsel.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 108,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "6E31F34ECDF9D8E7",
      "text": "Na, so was! Ich bin ganz gerührt, dass du mich\\nansprichst.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 58,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "6E31F24ECDF9D734",
      "text": "Also, äh... Wie läuft’s denn so mit Jo?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "10079538DA4A0A53",
      "text": "Wir verstehen uns blendend!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "10079638DA4A0C06",
      "text": "Ganz okay.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "6E31F54ECDF9DC4D",
      "text": "Soso? Dann ist ja gut.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_02b",
      "hash64": "38C003E7FF9123DD",
      "text": "Soso? Na ja, solange ihr euch nicht streitet...[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 47,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "6E31F44ECDF9DA9A",
      "text": "Weißt du, er... er strengt sich grad total an.\\nAn der Akademie, in der AG, überall.[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 83,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "6E31EF4ECDF9D21B",
      "text": "Ich sag nicht, dass du ihm eine Stütze sein sollst\\noder so... Vertrag dich einfach gut mit ihm,\\r\\nso wie vorher, okay?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 119,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_select_03",
      "hash64": "10079738DA4A0DB9",
      "text": "Natürlich!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_select_04",
      "hash64": "10079838DA4A0F6C",
      "text": "Wenn du drauf bestehst!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_05",
      "hash64": "6E31EE4ECDF9D068",
      "text": "Stimmt, das muss ich dir nicht extra sagen.\\nIhr zwei seid schließlich Freunde![VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0044"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "coach_bb_sister_sp03_05b",
      "hash64": "38A7F9E7FF7C80FE",
      "text": "Das tu ich! Also sei ihm mir zuliebe [VAR 0x1100(00FF,0909,0000)]ein gutereine gute\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0806,0000)]FreundFreundin, ja?[VAR 0x0114(0044)]",
